","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-07T07:15:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:37:11Z","closed_at":"2026-09-07T15:30:56Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible: 4.7.2.stable.mono.official.ed1daf0bf\n- Not reproducible: 4.7.1.stable.mono.official.a13da4feb\n\nBoth versions were tested on the same Windows installation with the newer Microsoft Korean IME enabled.\n\n### System information\n\n Windows 11 25H2 (OS build 26200.9168), x64 AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D Microsoft Korean IME\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen typing Korean in Godot 4.7.2, the caret does not advance correctly between syllables. The next syllable replaces the previous one instead of being appended.\n\nFor example, when trying to type `가나다`, typing `나` after `가` replaces `가` rather than producing `가나`.\n\nThis affects text input throughout the editor, including text fields and the script editor.\n\nExpected behavior:\nCompleted syllables should be committed, and the caret should advance, allowing `가나다` to be entered normally.\n\nAdditional observations:\n- The same input works correctly in Godot 4.7.1.\n- Korean input works correctly in other applications, such as Notepad.\n- Pasting Korean text into Godot works correctly.\n- Enabling Windows' \"Use previous version of Microsoft IME\" compatibility option resolves the issue in Godot 4.7.2.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ca0cc11-d83f-4066-bd83-cba0fffa7ab7\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n\n1. Use Microsoft Korean IME on Windows.\n2. In the Microsoft IME settings, turn OFF \"Use previous version of Microsoft IME\".\n3. Launch Godot 4.7.2 .NET.\n4. Focus a text input field and switch to Korean input mode.\n5. Type `가나다` continuously, without spaces or manually moving the caret.\n6. Observe that subsequent syllables replace the previous syllable.\n7. Repeat in Godot 4.7.1 with the same IME setting: input works correctly.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A. This can be reproduced in the Project Manager's search field without opening a project.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123269/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}